  "prefLabel": "Mid 103.03 Council Meetings and Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mid 103.03 Council Meetings and Quorum.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 326-D:3, IV the council shall meet no fewer than 4 times a year and at such additional times as the council chair or a majority of the council members shall designate.\n\n(b) Pursuant to RSA 326-D:3, IV the quorum required for council meetings is a majority of members of the council who have been approved by the governor and council.\n\n(c) Members of the council shall elect a chairperson annually from among their members.\n\nSource. #7412, eff 12-5-00; ss by #14496, eff 2-8-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mid100.html"
}
